350
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,100
伯特
Bert.

351
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:15,700
伯特  伯特
Bert, Bert.

352
00:16:16,130 --> 00:16:17,430
伯特  伯特  伯特
Bert, Bert, Bert.

353
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:20,550
你想干嘛  谢尔顿
What do you want, Sheldon?

354
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:23,110
我希望咱们能重新一起工作
I would like us to work together again.

355
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:26,640
我保证不再乱发表地质学的言论
I promise to keep my geology comments to myself,

356
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:31,470
因为这些言论都太过分了  虽然有些很好笑
because while some of them are funny, all of them are mean.

357
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,680
这下尴尬了
Well, this is awkward.

358
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,490
莱纳德  你在这里干什么
Leonard, what are you doing here?

359
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:43,770
伯特找了我帮忙
Bert asked for my help.

360
00:16:43,770 --> 00:16:45,600
他是一个优秀的科学家
Yeah, he's an excellent scientist,

361
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:49,260
也不规定我上厕所的时间
and he doesn't tell me what time I can go to the bathroom.

362
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,840
我那是膀胱训练
It's called bladder training.

363
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:54,790
等你到了80岁  你会感谢我的
When you're in your 80s, you'll thank me for it.

364
00:16:54,790 --> 00:16:57,250
听着  谢尔顿  你对伯特不好
Look, Sheldon, you were a jerk to Bert,

365
00:16:57,250 --> 00:16:58,420
所以他不和你玩了
and he walked away from you.

366
00:16:58,420 --> 00:17:01,990
我觉得我可以向他好好讨教一番
So I feel like there's a lot he could teach me.

367
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:04,450
伯特  拜托
Bert, please.

368
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:06,730
我知道自己之前表现不太好
I know I behaved poorly in the past,

369
00:17:06,730 --> 00:17:08,750
但这次我保证会有所改变
but things will be different this time.

370
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,730
你会看到的
You'll see.

371
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:12,090
拜托  让我进来吧
Come on, let me in.

372
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:16,190
我们会一起欢笑
We'll have some laughs,

373
00:17:16,190 --> 00:17:19,270
一起计算同位素比值
we'll calculate some isotope ratios.

374
00:17:22,870 --> 00:17:24,410
抱歉  谢尔顿
I'm sorry, Sheldon.

375
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:29,600
你就这样让他吃闭门羹吗
So you just shut the door in his face?

376
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:32,040
我得开始记录下你的招数了
I got to start writing this stuff down.

377
00:17:34,870 --> 00:17:36,240
虽然如琪是个好人
I mean, Ruchi's nice.

378
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,600
但我俩太不同了
We're just so different.

379
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:39,100
我懂你  有时候跟别人交往
I know. Sometimes when you're dating,

380
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,560
都会碰到奇奇怪怪的人
you meet weird people.

381
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:43,350
我还交往过不喜欢看人杂耍的女孩呢
I once met a girl who didn't like juggling.

382
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:46,250
她现在依旧不喜欢
And she still doesn't.

383
00:17:48,010 --> 00:17:49,420
所以你们不会再见面了吗
So you're not gonna see her again?

384
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,470
还有什么意义啊
What's the point?

385
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:52,440
我俩永远不会真正谈恋爱
We're never gonna be in a real relationship.

386
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:55,210
所以你俩只能是肉体关系吗
Right, so you'll only be in a physical one?

387
00:17:55,210 --> 00:17:55,820
没错
Exactly.

388
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:57,640
我干嘛和那种人耗费时间
Why would I want to spend time with someone like that?

389
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:00,700
那种只对滚床单有兴趣的人吗
Someone who is just interested in sex?

390
00:18:01,150 --> 00:18:02,080
没错
Yeah.

391
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:04,910
-拉杰  你好好...  -等一下
- Raj, do you real... ?- Whoa, hold on.

392
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:07,120
给他一点时间  他会想通的
Give him a chance. He's gonna get this.

393
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:11,530
我觉得他不会
I don't think he is.

394
00:18:12,410 --> 00:18:13,600
有什么可想的
What is there to get?

395
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,050
她不想和人坠入爱河
She doesn't want to fall in love.

396
00:18:15,050 --> 00:18:15,700
这样的话
At that point,

397
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:17,360
我们就只是两个单身人士
all we are is two single people

398
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:19,250
互相觉得对方有魅力  也喜欢做...
who find each other attractive and enjoy having--

399
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:20,790
我得走了
Oh, got to go!

400
00:18:27,190 --> 00:18:28,620
你和如琪昨晚如何
So how was your night with Ruchi?

401
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:29,520
很好
Oh, great.

402
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:32,920
我们点了外卖  滚了床单  然后拍屁股走人
We ordered in some food, we had sex, I left.

403
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:35,750
我甚至不用问她爽不爽
I didn't even ask if she enjoyed it.

404
00:18:36,410 --> 00:18:38,510
这道题我可以替她回答了
I can field that one for her.

405
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:42,030
我道别时的确有点小哽咽
I mean, I did get a little misty when we said good-bye,

406
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:43,630
不过我假装自己过敏了
but I played it off as allergies.

407
00:18:43,630 --> 00:18:45,060
不知道她相信没
I don't know if she bought it.

408
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,560
再一次  我知道答案
Again, I know.

409
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,010
谢尔顿
Sheldon?

410
00:18:51,220 --> 00:18:52,070
你还好吧
You okay?

411
00:18:52,390 --> 00:18:53,240
谢尔顿
Sheldon.

